# The Sleet Kilns' old kiln cave (CIPlay the_sleet_kilns_caves, 11-13 w11; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its
# recipe: a straight cave (kit_st, its own rock ridge) from the mouth at 30 -45 east (yaw 90, len 26, level) to the room
# where the first kiln stood, about 62 -45. In and out on foot.
island The Sleet Kilns keep
offset 3.8844 -2.5952
hour 11
weather Calm
picture sk_cave_out 16 18 -60 31 11 -45
walk 31.5 -45 to 38 -45 to 46 -45 to 54 -45 to 59 -45 below=15
picture sk_cave_in 40 13.6 -45 60 12 -45 light=20
walk 59 -45 to 54 -45 to 46 -45 to 38 -45 to 31.5 -45 below=15
